/-! Physical inclusion of the actual paired singleton palette [M,01] into
[M, nativeChain(M), 01], then elimination of every 01 occurrence by the actual
coefficient-derived interpolation programme. Labels map 0→0 and 1→2; every
original ordered port, edge and vertex occurrence survives the inclusion.
The coefficient field/presentation is the same one generated by original M/X.
No Ready, pure equality core, free unary pins or successful reduction is input. -/
noncomputable section
namespace Holant.LocalDrafts.RemoteWork.HardnessChainV1.SparseOriginalPairAccess
open Turing Computability Holant Holant.Tractable Holant.Algebraic Holant.Complexity
open BinaryCompose FixedFieldMachines FixedGadgetSubstitution
